    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Escape Simulator is a single-player parkour, action, adventure, escape, and survival game. Run, kill, hide, avoid deadly traps, explore endless mysterious escape routes, and escape the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Falling rocks, deadly traps, police, maze, giant waves, changing weather, height, and limited time. Can you overcome them all?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story of the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prisoner is in the world\u2019s highest security prison. His only chance to reunite with his family is to escape. Survive and escape Everything is in your hands. Survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you be able to escape from prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This survival-themed escape game will take your breath away. Experience an action-packed adventure and parkour challenge you can play endlessly. Explore the mysterious island and find your escape route. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your favorite weapon and fight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.poster.avif?t=1755644299\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.webm?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.mp4?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exciting Parkour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intense downhill parkour and show off your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/be85637469ae0687689b1edf022e4294.poster.avif?t=1755644299\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/be85637469ae0687689b1edf022e4294.webm?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/be85637469ae0687689b1edf022e4294.mp4?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the maze</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to escape the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/e5d2d67a32fc1949084bf6628b77e064.poster.avif?t=1755644299\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/e5d2d67a32fc1949084bf6628b77e064.webm?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/e5d2d67a32fc1949084bf6628b77e064.mp4?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn to use a helicopter and boat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/bd37ca0ff5dc9a1eeed799614be38115.poster.avif?t=1755644299\" width=794 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/bd37ca0ff5dc9a1eeed799614be38115.webm?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/bd37ca0ff5dc9a1eeed799614be38115.mp4?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the thrill of descending the mountain, monitor security cameras, immerse yourself in the story, fight with a variety of weapons, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy original music inspired by Hans Zimmer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique adventure with unlimited different endings and countless escape routes every time you play. Add the game to your wishlist to be among the first to try this one-of-a-kind experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Escape Simulator is a single-player parkour, action, adventure, escape, and survival game. Run, kill, hide, avoid deadly traps, explore endless mysterious escape routes, and escape the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Falling rocks, deadly traps, police, maze, giant waves, changing weather, height, and limited time. Can you overcome them all?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story of the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prisoner is in the world\u2019s highest security prison. His only chance to reunite with his family is to escape. Survive and escape Everything is in your hands. Survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you be able to escape from prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This survival-themed escape game will take your breath away. Experience an action-packed adventure and parkour challenge you can play endlessly. Explore the mysterious island and find your escape route. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your favorite weapon and fight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.poster.avif?t=1755644299\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.webm?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.mp4?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exciting Parkour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intense downhill parkour and show off your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/be85637469ae0687689b1edf022e4294.poster.avif?t=1755644299\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/be85637469ae0687689b1edf022e4294.webm?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/be85637469ae0687689b1edf022e4294.mp4?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the maze</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to escape the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/e5d2d67a32fc1949084bf6628b77e064.poster.avif?t=1755644299\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/e5d2d67a32fc1949084bf6628b77e064.webm?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/e5d2d67a32fc1949084bf6628b77e064.mp4?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn to use a helicopter and boat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/bd37ca0ff5dc9a1eeed799614be38115.poster.avif?t=1755644299\" width=794 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/bd37ca0ff5dc9a1eeed799614be38115.webm?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/bd37ca0ff5dc9a1eeed799614be38115.mp4?t=1755644299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the thrill of descending the mountain, monitor security cameras, immerse yourself in the story, fight with a variety of weapons, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy original music inspired by Hans Zimmer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique adventure with unlimited different endings and countless escape routes every time you play. Add the game to your wishlist to be among the first to try this one-of-a-kind experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
